@startuml
!include common.puml
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
package "Web 页面\nVue 路由 登录态" as Web
package "Spring Boot 单个应用进程" as Backend {
  package "M3 review\n核验与异议" as Review
  package "M2 poi\n采集与地图" as Poi
  package "M4 messaging\n通知与聊天" as Messaging
  package "M1 identity\n用户与角色" as Identity
}
Web .down.> Backend : HTTPS 四模块 API
Review .right.> Poi : 版本端口
Review .down.> Messaging : 通知端口
Review .down.> Identity : 身份与角色
Poi .down.> Messaging : 新数据通知
Poi .down.> Identity : 采集权限
Messaging .left.> Identity : 收件人及群成员
@enduml
